  "details": "1.) Open VRChat\n\n2.) Join a World with a friend\n\n3.) See if you can see them scaling. \n\n4.) It seems to be inconsistent? \n\nIn the GIF the robot person is showing where the yellow person's eyes are on their screen (not open beta) and you can clearly see the person didn't get bigger on my screen, despite the bubble size increasing. The person scales properly on the live version, but does not scale properly on the open beta. There were two of us on open beta and we both had the same issue. Changing worlds didn't fix it. All 3 of us have all of us enabled fully. \n\nThe one of us (the robot) who was not on the open beta could see the yellow person scaling perfectly, but the two of us on the open beta (me and another person) could not see them scaling properly. Might be worth looking in to!\n\nSorry for the spiel! Happy to provide context in a reply if anything is needed. \n\n(please excuse the gif quality, I crunched it down to 8MB)",
